# NotMitEdu_Kerberos

## Overview

Redistributes MIT Kerberos 5 (krb5) 1.22.2 (its shared libraries, headers, and client/admin tools) built as a dk package for macOS and Linux.

`NotMitEdu_Kerberos` builds MIT Kerberos 5 release 1.22.2 from upstream
source and redistributes the resulting shared libraries (`libkrb5`,
`libgssapi_krb5`, `libk5crypto`, and friends), development headers, and
client/admin executables such as `kinit`, `klist`, and `kadmin`, compiled
for Darwin (arm64, x86_64) and Linux (x86_64, x86, arm64). The setuid
`ksu` helper is deliberately excluded from the distribution.

